[
  {
    "id": "sim-zh-0064#0",
    "text": "要说最喜欢的颜色，那肯定是紫色。"
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-zh-0064#1",
    "text": "我妈最爱的颜色是蓝色。"
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-zh-0064#2",
    "text": "我也觉得蓝色挺不错的。"
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-zh-0064#3",
    "text": "颜色里头，我最中意蓝色。"
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-en-0065#0",
    "text": "For me, green tea is the best."
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-en-0065#1",
    "text": "Honestly, coffee is pretty good too."
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-zh-0066#0",
    "text": "饮品里我最喜欢的就数椰子水了。"
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-zh-0066#1",
    "text": "椰子水依然是我的最爱。"
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-zh-0066#2",
    "text": "乌龙茶感觉也挺好，搞不好更喜欢。"
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-zh-0066#3",
    "text": "说到底，最爱的还是椰子水。"
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-zh-0066#4",
    "text": "刚刷到个视频，正好在说豆浆。"
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-en-0067#0",
    "text": "My home base is Chengdu."
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-en-0067#1",
    "text": "I could be living in Shenzhen next year, though I'm not sure."
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-en-0067#2",
    "text": "I'm in Hangzhou now — just moved."
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-en-0067#3",
    "text": "Actually, I got that wrong — I live in Beijing."
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-en-0067#4",
    "text": "Beijing is still home for me."
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-zh-0068#0",
    "text": "花里面，百合是我的最爱。"
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-zh-0068#1",
    "text": "要论花的话，玫瑰是我的心头好。"
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-zh-0068#2",
    "text": "我改主意了，绣球花成了我现在的最爱。"
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-zh-0068#3",
    "text": "玫瑰似乎也挺好，没准儿更合我心意。"
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-en-0069#0",
    "text": "Cycling is the sport I like most."
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-en-0069#1",
    "text": "Honestly, cycling isn't my thing anymore."
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-zh-0070#0",
    "text": "颜色里我最中意的就是米白色。"
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-zh-0070#1",
    "text": "米白色我已经不喜欢了。"
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-en-0071#0",
    "text": "I'd say tacos are my top choice."
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-en-0071#1",
    "text": "I'm a fan of dumplings as well."
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-en-0071#2",
    "text": "Just came across a video on pizza."
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-zh-0072#0",
    "text": "要说喜欢的颜色，那得是绿色。"
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-zh-0072#1",
    "text": "紫色我也挺喜欢的。"
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-zh-0072#2",
    "text": "蓝色是我朋友的最爱。"
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-zh-0072#3",
    "text": "真要说的话，墨绿色最合我心意。"
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-zh-0072#4",
    "text": "紫色是我室友的最爱。"
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-en-0073#0",
    "text": "My top sport is cycling."
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-en-0073#1",
    "text": "Saw a video on badminton just now."
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-zh-0074#0",
    "text": "饮品里，柠檬水是我的首选。"
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-zh-0074#1",
    "text": "说不定我更爱乌龙茶，不过还没想好。"
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-en-0075#0",
    "text": "When it comes to drinks, oolong tea is my top pick."
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-en-0075#1",
    "text": "My mum's top choice is lemonade."
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-en-0075#2",
    "text": "As far as drinks go, lemonade is my favourite."
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-en-0075#3",
    "text": "My mum's favourite drink is coffee."
  }
]
